    <cac:ProcurementProject xmlns="">
        <cbc:Name languageID="ENG">WSC/T/095/2025 - DESIGN, BUILD, TEST AND COMMISSION AN UPGRADE OF THE GOZO WASTEWATER TREATMENT PLANT USING ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY MEASURES AND FIDIC CONDITIONS FOR THE WATER SERVICES CORPORATION</cbc:Name>
        <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">The subject of this tender is the Design, Build, Test and Commissioning an upgrade of the Gozo wastewater treatment plant using environmentally friendly measures and FIDIC Conditions. The scope of this project is to provide process and hydraulic resilience to this plant and ensure effective and efficient treatment of all raw wastewaters generated for a period covering at least up to the year 2040. The Gozo wastewater plant shall be upgraded to treat an average capacity of 14,000 cubic metres per day. The offer/s shall also include the design, installation, testing and commissioning of a new water reclamation plant for the production of an additional 4,000 cubic metres of ‘New Water’. The project shall be implemented in two (2) phases as described in detail in Section 3 – Employer Requirements.</cbc:Description>
